  "notes": {
    "injected_args": "The proxy sends client:\"Codex\" or client:\"Claude\" for the selected driver on action tools (FSB rejects other labels, e.g. \"Claude Code\", with BADGE_NOT_ALLOWED) and fills visual_reason when the agent omits it. client is removed from the schemas the agent sees.",
    "url_source": "After each action the proxy reads metadata.source_url from its own capture_screenshot (tab.url read right after Page.captureScreenshot, extension/utils/screenshot-capture.js:603), so the URL matches the saved frame. Fallbacks: change_report.url.after, then url/currentUrl in the action result JSON.",
    "excluded": "press_key and coordinate/drag tools need OS window focus; execute_js, search (Google fallback), tab tools, capture_screenshot, site-guide, memory, capability, vault, agent, trigger, session and run_task tools are hidden and denied."
  }
